segment.source:
::He inputs the amount.::

Oooookay. We only give refunds in case the race gets canceled.

Now - the *money* - and I'll print you your wagerin' ticket.&lt;end&gt;

::The machine prints a wagering ticket with a loud *brrrrrr*, a ticket which he grabs and hands to you with little care.::

Bring this to me after the race to settle your bet. Also, dead hoppers maintain their placements at the end of the race.

Okay, who's next?&lt;end&gt;

